 Express themselves in a variety of ways  but always in a manner that seems  beneficial to  scp-2761 Banana zilla's gigantic body is  capable of explosive bursts at speed  much like soft-shelled turtles which  over the course of their Natural  Evolution sacrificed more protective  armor to gain greater Mobility for the  purposes of detecting prey bananazilla  has 16 barbells more commonly referred  to as catfish whiskers which like its  frill are fully retractable in terms of  physical appearance  scp-2761 has many traits in common with  American alligators this includes the  over 100 undifferentiated conical teeth  which  scp-2761 can use to devour live prey  there are nearly 60 additional rows of  teeth with an  scp-2761's mouth which on the off chance  that the hybrid loses any teeth in the  front row will naturally move forward to  replace them the process by which  scp-2761 regenerates lost teeth is  nearly identical to that of a bull shark  however the replacement teeth vary in  shape and apparent utility some rows of  banana zilla's backup teeth are  uniformly serrated and evenly spaced  while other rows are villiform with  prominent elongated canines like that of  a yellowtail snapper fish a dental  examination of  scp-2761 revealed that towards the back  of its mouth there were even rows of  teeth that bore an uncanny resemblance  to those found within a species of great  ape the human species to be exact the  alligator-like claws at the end of  scp-2761's powerful compact limbs have  sticky pads on the underside which have  enough adhesive strength to allow  scp-2761 to climb into trees and across  other uneven surfaces such as the  artificial Rock we've provided banana  Zilla in its containment unit for the  purpose of exercise and stimulation  these adhesive pads are identical to the  ones found on the toes of green and oily  lizards which  scp-2761 appears to have inherited other  characteristics from such as the ability  to perceive ultraviolet light and  limited color changing for the purpose  of camouflage when  scp-2761 was first discovered deep in  the heart of the Florida Everglades the  range of its color changing ability  comprise several shades of green and  brown from a vibrant lustrous green like  that of an emerald gemstone to a dark  muddy Hue that made it nearly invisible  in murky water it is believed that the  consistent diet of banana fruit that the  foundation provides to  scp-2761 has been able to gradually  offset its camouflage capabilities  inadvertently causing it to retain the  natural coloration of bright yellow that  it has become known for the secret to  scp-2761's vast amount of genetic  information lies in its cellular  structure each cell in SCP 2761's bulky  body has an abnormally large nucleus  with a primary genome makeup of hundreds  of distinct genes there are additional  genomes stored separately within the  nuclei as well which have been heavily  scrutinized by research Personnel of  level 3 and above all available data  seems to suggest that  scp-2761's full genetic code contains  the completely unaltered genomes of  every species it has ever eaten this  includes a diverse microbiome of  bacteria and organic compounds which  would be hazardous to most other  creatures but seem to only affect the  hybrid carnivore's Health in terms of  conferring benefits though the various  diseases and genetic disorders that  scp-2761 Harbors within its body present  no safety risk to the SCP itself any  bloodborne or contagious strains of  microscopic life are still more than  capable of having their usual adverse  effects on other species to prevent the  spread of these harmful pathogens the  foundation has lined the containment  unit for scp-20 761 with lead as the  heavy metal is known to induce  antimicrobial activity despite the  tendency for  scp-2761 to undergo rapid mutation  within its primary genome the numerous  unaltered genomes within its cells have  never shown signs of independent  mutation instead these unaltered genomes  serve as a function that is  metaphorically comparable to the extra  rows of teeth within  scp-2761's mouth whenever the primary  genome suffers damage or makes contact  with potentially hazardous new stimuli  genetic information is transferred from  the unaltered genomes to repair  scp-2761's genetic expression and in the  process cause further beneficial  mutations to take place in short  scp-2761 is capable of storing  unexpressed genetic data within its  cells which then becomes apparent in its  physical characteristics provided that  those changes make it fitter to survive  in its current environment the untapped  potential of this advanced form of  genetic rearrangement has become  increasingly enticing to the foundation  not unlike the enticing Taste of a fresh  delicious banana as the saying goes  scp-2761 is what it eats therefore it  stands to reason that altering the  hybrid's food intake could over time  lead to a genetic expression that would  there improve useful to the foundation's  goals this is especially true when the  mutable properties of  scp-2761 are compared to those of a  similar but far more dangerous reptilian  SCP the infamous  scp-682 while scp-682 is nearly  impossible to destroy due to its  instantaneous adaptation the changes to  its physiology recede and disappear when  no longer required to ensure its  Survival  scp-2761 on the other hand retains the  sum total of every useful feature it has  gleaned from its diet presently  scp-2761 possesses barely a fraction of  scp-682's overall strength and  destructive capability but if raised  properly within a long enough time frame  with a steady and balanced diet of the  optimal anomalous and non-anomalous  organisms it is theorized that  scp-2761 could be molded into the ideal  countermeasure for its reptilian rival  and most crucially to the plan because  banana Zilla hunts only out of  carnivorous Instinct for sustenance and  survival it lacks any of the malice  towards other life which defines the  Twisted joker-like psychology of the  hard to destroy reptile if this  desirable outcome Were Somehow to be  achieved the final containment of  scp-682 would be all but assured even if  its total impermanent destruction remain  forever out of the foundation's reach  for now even the notion of broadening  scp-2761's diet has been deemed to be  far too risky to attempt even a  mouth-watering jumbo-sized bucket of  seemingly harmless non-specific  restaurant brand chicken wings could  cause the hybrid to develop razor-sharp  Talons a highly disturbing morning call  or an unforeseen boost in intelligence  that might Aid in its escaping  containment not to mention the possible  spread of Avian Influenza though the  finer details regarding banana zilla's  genetics are known only to sufficiently  high-ranking members of the genetic  research team rumors have circulated  throughout site-71 that this humble SCP  may still prove to be an incredible  asset in another way if the highly  adaptable cells within its body can  somehow be replicated this has recently  been the obsession of one Dr scapelli  Who as an Avid Reader of comic books and  manga has hypothesized or more  accurately fantasized that the human  genome could be augmented through the  integration of transplanted cells from  scp-2761 in scapelli's eyes which by all  estimates are filled with a naive  optimism generally unexpected in a level  3 researcher a successful transplant  could turn a regular human being into a  highly adaptable mutant super being able  to become stronger with every meal  admits the persistent worry of his  scientific peers Dr scapelli has in his  off-duty hours drafted unofficial plans  for what he believes could be the  greatest mobile task force the  foundation has ever known these heroic  Warriors would be given the designation  mobile task force Tau 68 but all the  villains in the world would know and  fear them by their clever and ingenious  code name The Banana Splits while every  recipient of a successful banana Zilla  cell transplant would be allowed into  the group a core team of Specialists  would be chosen to embody Dr scapelli's  wildly imaginative and yet incredibly  specific tastes standing at the top of  the food chain would be the task Force's  chief commander Apex man with an  all-meat diet consisting of mostly  deadly predators from around the globe  Apex man would bear the responsibilities  of leadership Badger the bad guys wolf  down all snakes in the grass and  Crocodile Rock the world into  Everlasting peace with his egalitarian  ways and he's not not lion okay we'll  stop for now  [Laughter]  oh fun Apex man's loyal second in  command would be honeygirl empowered by  the environmental DNA of thousands of  pollinated plants and the bees that tend  to them this graceful soldier of Justice  would have the foundation's enemies  sneezing from Mercy with her countless  allergenic attacks flower power indeed  next of course would be the lord of the  sea a pescetarian who's always part  shellfish but never a bit selfish when  it comes to saving the day his powerful  retractable tentacles would squeeze the  fight out of even the most wicked  villain and with shark-like teeth of his  own he never failed to take a bite out  of anomalous crime watching over the  team from the skies is wild turkey  gobbling up important reconnaissance  data as quickly as he gobbles up his  favorite poultry dishes this bad Birdman  is here to give evildoers a foul time  last but not least would be the teen  tofu Titan himself the cube 100 boy 100  soy yeah I know doctors Capelli's  eventual proposal for mobile task force  Tau 68 was met with uproarious laughter  and was unanimously turned down by every  level three and higher Personnel who was  present to hear it 05-1 actually gave  him 10 bucks afterwards as thanks for  giving him such a good giggle Dr  scapelli was not pleased disgraced and  humiliated Dr scafelli chose to take a  lengthy sabbatical from site 71 but as  he packed up his notes for mobile task  force Tau 68 which included several  pencil and paper illustrations he had  done by hand the researcher was overcome  with a sense of righteous purpose The  Banana Splits were an idea so brilliant  that he couldn't just give up on them if  the foundation wouldn't help Dr scapelli  realize his dream he had an idea who  would on the night before he departed  from site-71 scapelli used his authority  as a member of level 3 Personnel to  access the research lab and secure a DNA  sample from scp-2761  he proceeded to erase any and all  records of him having entered the lab  that night without any further delay Dr  scapelli booked a non-stop flight to the  Sunshine State of Florida he had one  destination in mind the Orlando regional  headquarters of aquagene surely the  company responsible for accidentally  creating banana Zilla would understand  the importance of using their genetic  research for the betterment of the world  yes of course they would understand  scapelli thought to himself as he fell  asleep on the plane while he napped Dr  scapelli dreamed of the Glorious Day  that his secret mobile task force would  save the world and prove everyone who  ever doubted him to be totally in the  wrong in the dream several dangerous  scps had escaped containment including  scp-058 the Heart of Darkness this  cutter-class monstrosity was on a brutal  Rampage throughout its containment  facility lashing out with its horrifying  tendrils at any Personnel Within Reach  just when all hope seemed lost Dr  scapelli would arrive with mobile task  force Tau 68 in  of the coolest and strongest members of  the super team were standing at his side  ready for action Apex man honey girl the  lord of the sea wild turkey and the cube  Banana Splits assemble Dr scapelli's  Dream self shouted his genetically  modified Heroes proceeded to bring the  ultimate Smackdown to scp-05