as able to secure an  impromptu meeting with two of the  scientists in aquagine's employee Dr  Pearl Watkins and Dr Marcus Nakamura  both Watkins and nakam Mora had been  previously contacted by Foundation  researcher Matthew Leo under the guise  of meeting with the EPA the foundation  had been keeping tabs on them since then  while maintaining their cover while the  scientists had assisted in the  successful containment of  scp-2761 the potential of Aqua Gene's  genetic technology needed to be  monitored in the event of further  anomalous creation it wasn't difficult  for Dr scapelli to insert himself into  the narrative that aquagene already  believed posing as another agent of the  EPA looking to inspect the company's  policies of course since he was  operating without the permission of the  foundation Dr scapelli made sure that  the meeting was held at aquagene  headquarters Watkins and Nakamura were  apprehensive enough given the scrutiny  that researcher Leo had put them under  in their first meeting and became  increasingly alarmed as Dr scapelli  presented them with the scp-2761 sample  as well as his creative pitch it would  be a superhero group like in the movies  Dr scapelli exclaimed had being just  spoken at length about the viability of  mobile task force Tau 68. the aquagene  employees exchanged terror-stricken  looks Nakamura was the first to speak it  is a tempting offer Marcus began trying  to be polite but our budget is stretched  thin enough as it is your project he  jumped with shock as Dr scapelli cut him  off mid-sentence don't worry about the  funding I I can cover it out of pocket  sure I might have to take out a loan and  possibly apply for unemployment but  isn't saving the world worth any price  Watkins reported we try to do things  very carefully here agents Capelli I'll  be blunt what you're describing is far  beyond the scope of our research and  using live Human test subjects for this  seems highly unethical unethical Dr  scapelli said baffled what could  possibly be unethical about using people  to fight evil I think what Pearl is  trying to say is Nakamura chimed in this  all seems a bit naive Dr scapelli sunk  into his chair feeling defeated first  the foundation had rejected his idea and  now aquagine too perhaps it really was  time to to give up on mobile Task Force  Town 68. if he pressed his luck any  further at Aqua Gene Ward could get back  to site-71 and he'd have to kiss his  career at the foundation goodbye and  potentially his memories if they decided  to give him a hefty dose of amnestics as  part of his severance package later that  night in the Resort Restaurant Dr  scapelli was crawling into his plate of  food his dreams of creating the world's  first superhero team had been crushed  that day and he still had the rest of  his sabbatical to spend in Florida as he  tried to eat a steak he was reminded of  Apex man and broke down in tears all  over again the other restaurant patrons  were beginning to stare at Dr scapelli  and he was about to consider leaving  when a man in Dark Shades approached his  table and sat down across from him the  man waited for scapelli disease his  weeping before formally introducing  himself as Dr Gregory Higgins he claimed  to be a former employee at aquagine and  had used Insider information from an old  colleague to learn about Dr scapelli's  meeting with Watkins and Nakamura by  tracing the call from the resort earlier  that that afternoon it wasn't that  difficult to track the foundation  researcher down are you gonna call me  naive too scapelli said far from it  Higgins replied wearing a mischievous  grin I think your idea has potential you  really mean it skipelly's face lit up  Higgins laugh of course but then again  what do I know I'm just the guy who  created that banana Zilla he continued  it was a complete accident of course but  I think we could really make Pearl and  Marcus regret ever doubting us if this  superhero thing goes the way you